# The published image ships the PRR-only bookshelf: the 11 PRR400 study-unit
# books plus the shared infra (root files, lib/, assets/). Everything else
# under site/ belongs to other modules / upstream sample books and is excluded.
site/*
!site/index.html
!site/404.html
!site/_redirects
!site/lib/
!site/assets/
